<title>USA: America West sets 50 pct summer fare sale.</title>
<headline>America West sets 50 pct summer fare sale.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>America West Airlines said it was offering a summer sale of up to 50 percent off normal 21-day advance purchase fares.</p>
<p>The sale began immediately and was available through April 29, 1997 for travel to be completed by October 8, it said.</p>
<p>Two-week advance purchase and other restrictions applied, the company said.</p>
<p>--New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
